+# Reactive Elf Priest loot routes
+
+Keep the original path to optional floor items until two recent loot approaches
+on the same level have run into tracked monsters. Use the Human Priest’s scoped
+monster-aware route while that evidence is fresh, then resume ordinary pathing
+when an approach makes progress or the evidence expires.
+
 # zLeadersSeed407717 (Claude, 2026-10-26)
 
 Identity router. Default base/ = github.com/daglar-dragomirov/nethacker@eab9a9c4f4e09bce096d5762e895fec51b63784d (unmodified).
